title: least gassy beans
pid: 5af09a5c-2055-4d06-b426-46a14b1bcabe
body: |2-
  Ranked, best at top, according to Claude.

  - Split yellow moong dal.
  - Red lentils.
  - Sprouted whole moong beans.
  - Toor/arhar dal (pigeon peas).
  - Adzuki beans, even though they are usually whole and with skin.
  - Moth beans.
  - Chana dal: small split chickpeas.
